{"ts": "2026-11-17T06:51:59.388516+00:00", "article_id": 5772, "kind": "tool_call", "batch": 6, "round": 1, "tool": "article_search", "args": {"query": "the Act", "before_sentence_id": 360474, "limit": 5}, "result": {"hits": [{"sentence_id": 360471, "idx": 0, "para_index": 15, "text": "The Supreme Court held that the seat and venue could not be used interchangeably and for excluding the ‘Part one’ of the Act, there has to be a positive act of determination of seat by the parties and, in case of their failure, by the arbitral tribunal.", "distance": 3}, {"sentence_id": 360460, "idx": 2, "para_index": 11, "text": "It is only by a series of judgments of the Supreme Court that the law has been laid down on several questions revolving around the ambiguous section of the Act.", "distance": 14}, {"sentence_id": 360459, "idx": 1, "para_index": 11, "text": "Section 20 of the Act merely talks about ‘place of arbitration’.", "distance": 15}, {"sentence_id": 360458, "idx": 0, "para_index": 11, "text": "It is interesting to note that the Act does not even mention the terms ‘seat’ and ‘venue’.", "distance": 16}, {"sentence_id": 360455, "idx": 1, "para_index": 9, "text": "It was further submitted that the grounds mentioned in Article 34 of the UNCITRAL Model Law have been, mutatis mutandis, incorporated in section 34 of the Act.", "distance": 19}], "count": 5}}
